#: includes/functions.php
msgid "Bad File Format - No Slow Query Log Entries Found"
msgstr "Ìrísí Fáìlì Kò Dára - A Kò Rí Àwọn Àkọsílẹ̀ Ìbéèrè Fífàlẹ̀ Kankan"

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "The initial Slowlog has been ingested.  Post Processing will take place in the background.  You can start analyzing the Details once the status is complete"
msgstr "A ti gba Slowlog àkọ́kọ́ wọlé. Ìṣiṣẹ́ Lẹ́yìn-ìkówọlé yóò wáyé ní abẹ́lẹ̀. O lè bẹ̀rẹ̀ sí í ṣe àtúpalẹ̀ Àwọn Àlàyé nígbà tí ipò bá ti parí"

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "Post Processing Failed - Database Error"
msgstr "Ìṣiṣẹ́ Lẹ́yìn-ìkówọlé Kùnà - Àṣìṣe Dátábéèsì"

#: includes/functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "max_execution_time is %d seconds (not unlimited) for this request - a large import could be killed mid-run. Some web servers/proxies (Apache Timeout, Nginx fastcgi_read_timeout/proxy_read_timeout, PHP-FPM request_terminate_timeout) enforce their own independent cutoff that this setting cannot override."
msgstr "max_execution_time jẹ́ ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá %d (kì í ṣe aláìlópin) fún ìbéèrè yìí - a lè pa ìkówọlé ńlá láàárín ìṣiṣẹ́. Àwọn sáfà wẹ́ẹ̀bù/pírọ́ksì kan (Apache Timeout, Nginx fastcgi_read_timeout/proxy_read_timeout, PHP-FPM request_terminate_timeout) ní òpin àkókò tiwọn lọ́tọ̀ tí ètò yìí kò lè borí."

#: includes/functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "memory_limit is %s (not unlimited) for this request - a very large slow query log can exceed this while it is being read/imported."
msgstr "memory_limit jẹ́ %s (kì í ṣe aláìlópin) fún ìbéèrè yìí - àkọsílẹ̀ ìbéèrè fífàlẹ̀ tó tóbi púpọ̀ lè rékọjá èyí nígbà tí a bá ń kà á/kó o wọlé."

#: includes/functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "post_max_size (%s) is smaller than upload_max_filesize (%s) - uploads up to the advertised limit will still be rejected."
msgstr "post_max_size (%s) kéré ju upload_max_filesize (%s) lọ - àwọn ìgbékalẹ̀ tó dé òpin tí a kéde ṣì máa kọ̀."

#: includes/functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "upload_max_filesize (%s) is small for a MySQL/MariaDB slow query log, which can easily be hundreds of MB."
msgstr "upload_max_filesize (%s) kéré fún àkọsílẹ̀ ìbéèrè fífàlẹ̀ MySQL/MariaDB, tó lè tó ọgọ́rọ̀ọ̀rún MB ní rọọrun."

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "ERROR: The uploaded Slowlog file exceeds the server's maximum upload filesize."
msgstr "ÀṢÌṢE: Fáìlì Slowlog tí a gbé sókè rékọjá ìwọ̀n fáìlì tó pọ̀ jùlọ tí sáfà ń gbà."

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "ERROR: The Slowlog file upload was interrupted before it finished - please try again."
msgstr "ÀṢÌṢE: Ìgbésókè fáìlì Slowlog dúró ṣáájú kí ó tó parí - jọ̀wọ́ gbìyànjú lẹ́ẹ̀kan sí i."

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "ERROR: The server has no temporary folder configured to receive the uploaded Slowlog file."
msgstr "ÀṢÌṢE: Sáfà kò ní fọ́ódà ìgbàdíẹ̀ tí a ṣètò láti gba fáìlì Slowlog tí a gbé sókè."

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "ERROR: The server failed to write the uploaded Slowlog file to disk."
msgstr "ÀṢÌṢE: Sáfà kùnà láti kọ fáìlì Slowlog tí a gbé sókè sórí díìskì."

#: includes/functions.php
msgid "ERROR: A server extension blocked the Slowlog file upload."
msgstr "ÀṢÌṢE: Àfikún sáfà kan dí ìgbésókè fáìlì Slowlog lọ́wọ́."

#: includes/functions.php
#, php-format
msgid "ERROR: The Slowlog file upload failed (error code %d)."
msgstr "ÀṢÌṢE: Ìgbésókè fáìlì Slowlog kùnà (kóòdù àṣìṣe %d)."

