#: slowlog.php
msgid "Cacti Table Detection"
msgstr "Ìṣàwárí Tábìlì Cacti"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "How to tell Cacti-native tables apart from other tables referenced in the slow query log. Defaults to detecting every table with no grouping."
msgstr "Bí a ṣe ń ya àwọn tábìlì ìbílẹ̀ Cacti sọ́tọ̀ kúrò lára àwọn tábìlì míràn tí a tọ́ka sí nínú àkọsílẹ̀ ìbéèrè fífàlẹ̀. Àìyípadà ni ṣíṣàwárí gbogbo tábìlì láìsí ìpínsíẹgbẹ́."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Detect all tables (no 'OTHER TABLES' grouping)"
msgstr "Ṣàwárí gbogbo àwọn tábìlì (kò sí ìpínsíẹgbẹ́ 'ÀWỌN TÁBÌLÌ MÍRÀN')"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Use this Cacti Database; group other tables as 'OTHER TABLES'"
msgstr "Lo Dátábéèsì Cacti yìí; pín àwọn tábìlì míràn sí ẹgbẹ́ gẹ́gẹ́ bí 'ÀWỌN TÁBÌLÌ MÍRÀN'"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Detect all tables; group tables not in the list below as 'OTHER TABLES'"
msgstr "Ṣàwárí gbogbo àwọn tábìlì; pín àwọn tábìlì tí kò sí nínú àtòjọ ìsàlẹ̀ sí ẹgbẹ́ gẹ́gẹ́ bí 'ÀWỌN TÁBÌLÌ MÍRÀN'"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Tables of Interest"
msgstr "Àwọn Tábìlì Tí A Nífẹ̀ẹ́ Sí"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Only used by the 'Detect all tables; group ... as OTHER TABLES' option above. Please provide a space delimited list of known tables to compare against. In Linux/UNIX, you may obtain a list of tables by using the following command:<br><br> print `mysql -u<i><b>user</b></i> -p<i><b>password</b></i> -e \"show tables\" <i><b>database</b></i> | grep -v Tables_in` | tr '\\n' ' '<br><br>The values of '<i><b>user</b></i>', '<i><b>password</b></i>', and '<i><b>database</b></i>' are replaced with your values."
msgstr "A lò ó nìkan fún àṣàyàn 'Ṣàwárí gbogbo àwọn tábìlì; pín ... sí ẹgbẹ́ gẹ́gẹ́ bí ÀWỌN TÁBÌLÌ MÍRÀN' lókè. Jọ̀wọ́ pèsè àtòjọ àwọn tábìlì tí a mọ̀ tí a fi ààyè pín láti fi wéra. Ní Linux/UNIX, o lè rí àtòjọ àwọn tábìlì gbà nípa lílo àṣẹ yìí:<br><br> print `mysql -u<i><b>olùlò</b></i> -p<i><b>ọ̀rọ̀-ìgbaniwọlé</b></i> -e \"show tables\" <i><b>dátábéèsì</b></i> | grep -v Tables_in` | tr '\\n' ' '<br><br>A fi àwọn iye tìrẹ rọ́pò àwọn iye '<i><b>olùlò</b></i>', '<i><b>ọ̀rọ̀-ìgbaniwọlé</b></i>', àti '<i><b>dátábéèsì</b></i>'."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Upload Limits"
msgstr "Àwọn Òpin Ìgbésókè"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "File Size upload limits in Cacti."
msgstr "Àwọn òpin ìwọ̀n fáìlì ìgbésókè ní Cacti."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Max Upload Filesize"
msgstr "Ìwọ̀n Fáìlì Ìgbésókè Tó Pọ̀ Jùlọ"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "The maximum filesize your Apache server will allow to be uploaded is set to the value on the right.  Currently, you can not upload a file larger than this.  If you have MySQL Slow logs larger than this, you must alter the <i>php.ini</i> file associated with Apache, find the variable <b><i>upload_max_filesize</i></b> and increase the value.  After which you must restart Apache."
msgstr "Ìwọ̀n fáìlì tó pọ̀ jùlọ tí sáfà Apache rẹ yóò gbà láti gbé sókè ni a ṣètò sí iye tó wà ní ọ̀tún. Lọ́wọ́lọ́wọ́, o kò lè gbé fáìlì tó tóbi ju èyí lọ sókè. Tí o bá ní àwọn àkọsílẹ̀ fífàlẹ̀ MySQL tó tóbi ju èyí lọ, o gbọ́dọ̀ yí fáìlì <i>php.ini</i> tó so mọ́ Apache padà, wá oníyípadà <b><i>upload_max_filesize</i></b> kí o sì mú iye rẹ̀ pọ̀ sí i. Lẹ́yìn èyí o gbọ́dọ̀ tún Apache bẹ̀rẹ̀."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Max Post Size"
msgstr "Ìwọ̀n Ìfìránṣẹ́ Tó Pọ̀ Jùlọ"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "The maximum size you can post to the Apache server is set to the value on the right.  If you have MySQL Slow logs larger than this value, you must alter the <i>php.ini</i> file associated with Apache, find the variable <b><i>post_max_size</i></b> and increase its value.  After which you must restart Apache."
msgstr "Ìwọ̀n tó pọ̀ jùlọ tí o lè fi ránṣẹ́ sí sáfà Apache ni a ṣètò sí iye tó wà ní ọ̀tún. Tí o bá ní àwọn àkọsílẹ̀ fífàlẹ̀ MySQL tó tóbi ju iye yìí lọ, o gbọ́dọ̀ yí fáìlì <i>php.ini</i> tó so mọ́ Apache padà, wá oníyípadà <b><i>post_max_size</i></b> kí o sì mú iye rẹ̀ pọ̀ sí i. Lẹ́yìn èyí o gbọ́dọ̀ tún Apache bẹ̀rẹ̀."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Max Execution Time"
msgstr "Àkókò Ìṣiṣẹ́ Tó Pọ̀ Jùlọ"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "How long (in seconds) this request is allowed to run for; 0 means unlimited. This plugin already raises it to unlimited for its own requests, but a web server or reverse proxy in front of PHP (Apache Timeout, Nginx fastcgi_read_timeout/proxy_read_timeout, PHP-FPM request_terminate_timeout) can still cut the request off independently - that cannot be detected or overridden from here."
msgstr "Bí ìbéèrè yìí ṣe pẹ́ tó (ní ìṣẹ́jú-àáyá) tí a gbà á láàyè láti ṣiṣẹ́; 0 túmọ̀ sí aláìlópin. Àfikún yìí ti gbé e sókè sí aláìlópin fún àwọn ìbéèrè tirẹ̀, ṣùgbọ́n sáfà wẹ́ẹ̀bù tàbí pírọ́ksì yíyípadà níwájú PHP (Apache Timeout, Nginx fastcgi_read_timeout/proxy_read_timeout, PHP-FPM request_terminate_timeout) ṣì lè gé ìbéèrè náà kúrú lọ́tọ̀ - a kò lè ṣàwárí tàbí borí èyí láti ibí."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Unlimited"
msgstr "Aláìlópin"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Memory Limit"
msgstr "Òpin Ìrántí"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "How much memory this request is allowed to use; -1 means unlimited. This plugin already raises it to unlimited for its own requests. A very large slow query log being read/imported in a single request can exceed a limited value."
msgstr "Bí ìrántí ṣe pọ̀ tó tí a gba ìbéèrè yìí láàyè láti lò; -1 túmọ̀ sí aláìlópin. Àfikún yìí ti gbé e sókè sí aláìlópin fún àwọn ìbéèrè tirẹ̀. Àkọsílẹ̀ ìbéèrè fífàlẹ̀ tó tóbi púpọ̀ tí a ń kà/kó wọlé nínú ìbéèrè kan ṣoṣo lè rékọjá iye tó ní òpin."

